  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Food Safety: Co funding of research designed and managed by DFID and Bill and Melinda Gates Foundation to fill key evidence gaps in the field of Agriculture for Nutrition and Health-Research is a component of Strategic Partnership on Agriculture and Food Systems for Nutrition reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;6,297,650. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Health policy and administrative management.</narrative>
